<title>FINLAND: K-SUOMEN MEDIA OFFERS S.SANOMAT REDEMPTION.</title>
<headline>K-SUOMEN MEDIA OFFERS S.SANOMAT REDEMPTION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Keski-Suomen Media said in a statement on Monday it had raised its stake in Savon Sanomat to 74.09 percent of shares and offered to redeem the rest at 67.00 markka per share or at 64.00 markka ex-dividend.</p>
<p>&quot;The redemption offer is valid from May 7 to June 9, 1997,&quot; the media house said.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
